sistive technology description for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check the answers. The responses will be marked as correct, incorrect, or unanswered.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Davranış ayarları\",\n      \"description\": \"Bu seçenekler aktivitenin çalışma şeklini denetlemenize izin verir.\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"\\\"Yeniden dene\\\" butonunu aktifleştirin\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"\\\"Çözümü göster\\\" butonunu aktifleştirin\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Enable \\\"Check\\\" button\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"\\\"Kontrol et\\\"deki onay kutucuğunu göster\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"\\\"Yeniden dene\\\"deki onay kutucuğunu göster\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Yanıtları otomatik olarak denetle\",\n          \"description\": \"Bu seçeneği etkinleştirmenin erişilebilirliği etkileyeceğini unutmayın\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Doğru cevap geribildirimi\",\n          \"description\": \"Bu varsayılan geribildirim metnini geçersiz kılar. Mevcut değişkenler: @score ve @total\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Yanlış cevap geribildirimi\",\n          \"description\": \"Bu varsayılan geribildirim metnini geçersiz kılar. Mevcut değişkenler: @score ve @total\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Onay kutucuğunu seçin\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Üstbaşlık Metni\",\n          \"default\": \"Bitir?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Gövde Metni\",\n          \"default\": \"Tamamlamak istediğinizden emin misiniz?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"İptal et düğmesi etiketi\",\n          \"default\": \"İptal et\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onay düğmesi etiketi\",\n          \"default\": \"Bitir\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Yeniden dene onay kutucuğu\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Üstbaşlık Metni\",\n          \"default\": \"Yeniden dene?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Gövde Metni\",\n          \"default\": \"Yeniden denemek istediğinizden emin misiniz?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"İptal et düğmesi etiketi\",\n          \"default\": \"İptal et\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onay düğmesi etiketi\",\n          \"default\": \"Onayla\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(581,31,'uk','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Медіа\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Тип\",\n          \"description\": \"Додаткове медіа для відображення над запитанням.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Відключити масштабування зображення\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Запитання\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Правильна відповідь\",\n      \"options\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Так\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ні\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Інтерфейс перекладів для  Так/Ні запитань\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки так\",\n          \"default\": \"Так\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки ні\",\n          \"default\": \"Ні\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст зворотнього зв\'зку\",\n          \"default\": \"Ти маєш @score з @total балів\",\n          \"description\": \"Текст зворотнього зв\'язку, доступні змінні: @score і @total. Наприклад: \'Ти маєш @score з @total можливих балів\'\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст для \\\"Перевірити\\\" кнопки\",\n          \"default\": \"Перевірити\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст для \\\"Показати відповідь\\\" кнопки\",\n          \"default\": \"Показати відповідь\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст для \\\"Повторити\\\" кнопки\",\n          \"default\": \"Повторити\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Неправильна відповідь\",\n          \"default\": \"Неправильна відповідь\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Правильна відповідь\",\n          \"default\": \"Правильна відповідь\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текстове подання шкали оцінок для тих, хто використовує динамік\",\n          \"default\": \"Ти маєш :num out з :total балів\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check the answers. The responses will be marked as correct, incorrect, or unanswered.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Параметри поведінки\",\n      \"description\": \"Ці параметри дозволяють керувати поведінкою завдання.\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Включити \\\"Повторити\\\" кнопку\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Включити \\\"Показати відповідь\\\" кнопку\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Включити \\\"Перевірити\\\" кнопку\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Показати діалогове вікно підтвердження \\\"Перевірити\\\"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Показати діалогове вікно підтвердження \\\"Повторити\\\"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Автоматично перевіряти відповідь\",\n          \"description\": \"Зауважте, що доступність погіршиться, якщо включити цю опцію\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Зворотній зв\'язок на правильну відповідь\",\n          \"description\": \"Це змінить текст зворотного зв\'язку за замовчуванням. Доступні змінні: @score і @total\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Зворотній зв\'зок на неправильну відповідь\",\n          \"description\": \"Це змінить текст зворотного зв\'язку за замовчуванням. Доступні змінні: @score and @total\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Перевірте діалогове вікно підтвердження\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст заголовку\",\n          \"default\": \"Закінчити?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Основний текст\",\n          \"default\": \"Ви впевнені, що хочете закінчити?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки скасувати\",\n          \"default\": \"Скасувати\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки підтвердити\",\n          \"default\": \"Закінчити\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Діалогове вікно підтвердження повторення\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Текст заголовку\",\n          \"default\": \"Повторити?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Основний текст\",\n          \"default\": \"Ви впевнені, що хочете повторити?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки скасувати\",\n          \"default\": \"Скасувати\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мітка кнопки підтвердити\",\n          \"default\": \"Підтвердити\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(582,31,'vi','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Media\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Type\",\n          \"description\": \"Optional media to display above the question.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Disable image zooming\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Question\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Correct answer\",\n      \"options\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"True\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"False\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"User interface translations for True/False Questions\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Label for true button\",\n          \"default\": \"True\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Label for false button\",\n          \"default\": \"False\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Feedback text\",\n          \"default\": \"You got @score of @total points\",\n          \"description\": \"Feedback text, variables available: @score and @total. Example: \'You got @score of @total possible points\'\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Text for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Text for \\\"Show solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show solution\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Text for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Wrong Answer\",\n          \"default\": \"Wrong answer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Correct Answer\",\n          \"default\": \"Correct answer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Textual representation of the score bar for those using a readspeaker\",\n          \"default\": \"You got :num out of :total points\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check the answers. The responses will be marked as correct, incorrect, or unanswered.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Behavioural settings\",\n      \"description\": \"These options will let you control how the task behaves.\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Enable \\\"Retry\\\" button\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Enable \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Enable \\\"Check\\\" button\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Show confirmation dialog on \\\"Check\\\"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Show confirmation dialog on \\\"Retry\\\"\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Automatically check answer\",\n          \"description\": \"Note that accessibility will suffer if enabling this option\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Feedback on correct answer\",\n          \"description\": \"This will override the default feedback text. Variables available: @score and @total\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Feedback on wrong answer\",\n          \"description\": \"This will override the default feedback text. Variables available: @score and @total\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Check confirmation dialog\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Header text\",\n          \"default\": \"Finish ?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Body text\",\n          \"default\": \"Are you sure you wish to finish ?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cancel button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Cancel\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Confirm button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Finish\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Retry confirmation dialog\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Header text\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry ?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Body text\",\n          \"default\": \"Are you sure you wish to retry ?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cancel button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Cancel\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Confirm button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Confirm\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(583,31,'zh-hans','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"媒体\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"类型\",\n          \"description\": \"非必要项，在问题上方要显示的媒体。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"停用题目上图片的放大功能\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"问题\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"正确答案\",\n      \"options\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"正确\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"错误\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"使用界面本地化\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"正确按钮的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"正确\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"错误按钮的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"错误\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"回馈文字\",\n          \"default\": \"你得到 @score 分，总分 @total 分。\",\n          \"description\": \"回馈文字，@score 表示得分，@total 表示总分。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"核对答案按钮的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"核对答案\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"显示正确答案按钮的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"显示正确答案\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"再试一次按钮的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"再试一次\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"答错时的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"答错咯…\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"答对时的显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"答对啦！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"报读器用结果文本（非显示用）\",\n          \"default\": \"你得到 :num 分，总分是 :total 分。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check the answers. The responses will be marked as correct, incorrect, or unanswered.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"行为设置\",\n      \"description\": \"用来控制任务行为的一些设定。\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"启用「再试一次」按钮\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"启用「显示正确答案」按钮\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"启用「核对答案」按钮\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"核对答案前弹出确认视窗\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"再试一次前弹出确认视窗\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"自动核对答案\",\n          \"description\": \"勾选后会导致无障碍功能失效\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"正确回馈讯息\",\n          \"description\": \"这会覆盖预设的答对时显示文字，可用变数为 @score 和 @total。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"错误回馈讯息\",\n          \"description\": \"这会覆盖预设的答错时显示文字，可用变数为 @score 和 @total。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"核对答案前的确认视窗\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"标题文字\",\n          \"default\": \"确定要核对吗？\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"内文文字\",\n          \"default\": \"完成后记得再仔细检查，避免粗心！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"取消按钮显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"取消\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"确定按钮显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"确定\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"再试一次前的确认视窗\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"标题文字\",\n          \"default\": \"确定要重试吗？\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"內文文字\",\n          \"default\": \"准备好了吗？挑战吧！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"取消按钮显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"取消\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"确定按钮显示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"确定\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(584,31,'zh-hant','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"媒體\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"類型\",\n          \"description\": \"非必要項，在問題上方要顯示的媒體。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"停用題目上圖片的放大功能\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"問題\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"正解\",\n      \"options\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"是\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"否\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"使用介面本地化\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"是的按鈕的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"是\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"否的按鈕的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"否\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"回饋文字\",\n          \"default\": \"你得到 @score 分，總分 @total 分。\",\n          \"description\": \"回饋文字，@score 表示得分，@total 表示總分。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"核對答案按鈕的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"核對答案\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"顯示正解按鈕的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"顯示正解\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"再試一次按鈕的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"再試一次\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"答錯時的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"答錯囉…\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"答對時的顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"答對啦！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"報讀器用結果文本（非顯示用）\",\n          \"default\": \"你得到 :num 分，總為是 :total 分。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Check\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Check the answers. The responses will be marked as correct, incorrect, or unanswered.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Show Solution\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Show the solution. The task will be marked with its correct solution.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Assistive technology description for \\\"Retry\\\" button\",\n          \"default\": \"Retry the task. Reset all responses and start the task over again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"行為設置\",\n      \"description\": \"用來控制任務行為的一些設定。\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"啟用「再試一次」按鈕\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"啟用「顯示正解」按鈕\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"啟用「核對答案」按鈕\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"核對答案前彈出確認視窗\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"再試一次前彈出確認視窗\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"自動核對答案\",\n          \"description\": \"勾選後會導致無障礙功能失效\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"正確回饋訊息\",\n          \"description\": \"這會覆蓋預設的答對時顯示文字，可用變數為 @score 和 @total。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"錯誤回饋訊息\",\n          \"description\": \"這會覆蓋預設的答錯時顯示文字，可用變數為 @score 和 @total。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"核對答案前的確認視窗\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"標題文字\",\n          \"default\": \"確定要核對嗎？\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"內文文字\",\n          \"default\": \"完成後記得再仔細檢查，避免粗心！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"取消按鈕顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"取消\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"確定按鈕顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"確定\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"再試一次前的確認視窗\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"標題文字\",\n          \"default\": \"確定要重試嗎？\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"內文文字\",\n          \"default\": \"準備好了？挑戰吧！\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"取消按鈕顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"取消\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"確定按鈕顯示文字\",\n          \"default\": \"確定\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(585,32,'af','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video bronne\",\n      \"description\": \"Om te verseker dat die video in alle webblaaiers werk, moet jy die WebM- en MP4-geformateerde bronne byvoeg.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Beeldmateriaal\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Plakkaatbeeld\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Pas die videospeler aan om alle beskikbare spasie te gebruik\",\n          \"description\": \"Indien dit nie ingestel is nie, sal die videospeler dieselfde beeldverhouding as die video hê.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Wys videospelerknoppies\",\n          \"description\": \"Voeg knoppies by die videospeler. Dit stel gebruikers in staat om te speel, te stop, ens.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Terugspeel\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Speel video outomaties\",\n          \"description\": \"Begin om die video outomaties te speel. Sal moontlik nie op mobiele toestelle werk nie.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Herhaal video\",\n          \"description\": \"Begin die video outomaties weer as dit eindig.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videolokalisering\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Naam\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Help om inhoud van hierdie soort te identifiseer.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Besig om te laai\",\n          \"default\": \"Videospeler laai...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Geen videospelers gevind\",\n          \"default\": \"Geen videospeler gevind wat die huidige formaat kan speel nie.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Geen bronne\",\n          \"default\": \"Video vermis bronne.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Gestaak\",\n          \"default\": \"Media terugspeel is gestaak.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Netwerkfout\",\n          \"default\": \"Netwerkfout.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kan nie videobron dekodeer nie\",\n          \"default\": \"Kan nie videobron dekodeer nie.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formaat word nie ondersteun nie\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoformaat word nie ondersteun nie.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media geënkripteer\",\n          \"default\": \"Media geënkripteer.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onbekende fout\",\n          \"default\": \"Onbekende fout.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ongeldige Youtube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ongeldige YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onbekende YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Kan nie video met die gegewe YouTube ID vind nie.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Beperkte YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"Die eienaar van die video laat nie toe dat ander dit inbed nie.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Toeganklikheid\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Voeg videosnit by\",\n          \"entity\": \"Snit\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Snit\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Snitetiket\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipe verwys na <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML lewensstandaard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Byskrif\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Onderskrifte\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Beskrywings\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Hoofstukke\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Brontaal moet deur onderskrifte ondersteun word\",\n                \"description\": \"Moet \'n geldige BCP 47 etiket wees. As die soortkenmerk op ondertitels ingestel is, moet brontaal gedefinieer word.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Snitleêr (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(586,32,'ar','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"مصادر الفيديو\",\n      \"description\": \"\\\"MP4\\\"للتأكد من أن الفيديو يعمل في جميع المتصفحات يجب عليك إضافة كل ويب إم وتنسيق المصادر\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"مرئيات\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"الملصق\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"مشغل فيديو مناسبا لاستخدام كل المساحة المتاحة\",\n          \"description\": \"إذا لم يتم تعيين مشغل فيديو سيكون لها نسبة الارتفاع نفس الفيديو\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"مشاهدة ضوابط مشغل فيديو\",\n          \"description\": \"إضافة عناصر تحكم إلى مشغل الفيديو. وهذا يسمح للمستخدمين للعب، وقفة، الخ\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"تشغيل\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"التشغيل التلقائي الفيديو\",\n          \"description\": \"بدء تشغيل الفيديو تلقائيا. قد لا تعمل على الأجهزة النقالة\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"تشغيل مستمر للفيديو\",\n          \"description\": \"بدء تلقائيا الفيديو مرة أخرى عندما ينتهي\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"توطين الفيديو\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"الاسم\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"يساعد على تحديد المضمون من هذا النوع\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"تحميل\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player loading...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"لا يوجد مشغل فيديو\",\n          \"default\": \"Found no video players that supports the given video format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"لا مصادر\",\n          \"default\": \"Video is missing sources.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"تم احباط المشغل\",\n          \"default\": \"Media playback has been aborted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"فشل الشبكة\",\n          \"default\": \"Network failure.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"لا يمكن فك شفرة مصدر الفيديو\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to decode media.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"صيغة غير مدعومة\",\n          \"default\": \"Video format not supported.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"وسائل الإعلام مشفرة\",\n          \"default\": \"Media encrypted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"خطأ غير معروف\",\n          \"default\": \"Unknown error.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"رابط يوتوب غير صالح\",\n          \"default\": \"معرف يوتيوب غير صالح.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"رابط يوتوب مجهول\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"فيديو يوتوب مقييد\",\n          \"default\": \"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"إمكانية الوصول\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"إضافة مسار الفيديو\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"تتبع المسار\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"اكتب النوع، ارجع إلى <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"عناوين فرعية\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"التسميات التوضيحية\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"الوصف\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"فصول\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"تتبع الملف (WebVTT)\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"تتبع الملف (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(587,32,'bg','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Изходни видеа\",\n      \"description\": \"За да си гарантирате, че видеото работи във всички браузъри, трябва да добавите изходни видеа, конвертирани едновременно в WebM и MP4 формат.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Визуални елементи\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Изображение за плакат\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Видео плейъра да използва цялото свободно пространство\",\n          \"description\": \"Ако не е активно, видео плейърът ще има същата пропорция и размери като изходното видео.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Покаpзване на контролния пункт на видео плейъра\",\n          \"description\": \"Добави контролен пункт към плейъра. Това ще позволи на потребителите да стартират, спират на пауза и т.н.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Възпроизвеждане\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Автоматично възпроизвеждане на видео\",\n          \"description\": \"Започнете автоматично възпроизвеждане на видеоклипа. Може да не работи при мобилни устройства.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Повтаряне на видео\",\n          \"description\": \"Автоматично стартирайте видеото отново, когато свърши.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Персонализиране на видеото\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Заглавие\",\n          \"default\": \"Видео\",\n          \"description\": \"Помага да се идентифицира съдържанието на този тип.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Зареждане\",\n          \"default\": \"Видеото се зарежда...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Няма намерени плейъри\",\n          \"default\": \"Няма намерени плейъри, които поддържат този видео формат.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Липса на източници\",\n          \"default\": \"Липсват източници.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Прекъсване\",\n          \"default\": \"Възпроизвеждането е прекъснато.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Грешка в мрежата\",\n          \"default\": \"Грешка в мрежата.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Невъзможност да се декодира видео източника\",\n          \"default\": \"Видеото не може да бъде декодирано.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Неподдържан формат\",\n          \"default\": \"Този видео формат не се поддържа.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Мултимедия е шифрована\",\n          \"default\": \"Мултимедия е шифрована\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Непозната грешка\",\n          \"default\": \"Непозната грешка.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Неточно YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Неточност в YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Непознато YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Невъзможно е да се намери видео с това YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Рестрикция на YouTube видео\",\n          \"default\": \"Собственикът на това видео не желае то да може да бъде вграждано/използвано.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Достъпност\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Добавете видеоклип\",\n          \"entity\": \"Пътека\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Пътека\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Етикет на пътеката\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Разгледайте тук, за повече информация <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Субтитри\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Надписи\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Описания\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Глави\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Трябва да бъде дефиниран езиков източник за субтитрите.\",\n                \"description\": \"Трябва да бъде посочен валиден таг за езика измежду BCP 47. Ако е настроено на субтитри, то тогава трябва да се дефинира srclang.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Трак файл (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(588,32,'bs','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Izvori videa\",\n      \"description\": \"Kako bi bili sigurni da video funkcionira u svim pretraživačima izvorni video treba biti postavljen u formatu WebM i MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Grafika\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Slika prikaza\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Den Videoplayer so anpassen, dass er den insgesamt verfügbaren Platz verwendet\",\n          \"description\": \"Wird dies nicht ausgewählt, hat der Videoplayer das gleiche Seitenverhältnis wie das Video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Prikaži podešavanja za video-plajer\",\n          \"description\": \"Ovo omogućava da korisnik video pusti, pauzira, isl.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Play\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Pusti automatski video\",\n          \"description\": \"Ovo moćda neće funkcionirati na mobilnim uređajima.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Problem sa videom\",\n          \"description\": \"Startaj video ispočetka.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video lokalizacija\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Naziv\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Pomaže da se identificira tip videa.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Učitava se\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoplajer se učitava...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nije pronađen player\",\n          \"default\": \"Keine Videoplayer gefunden, die das gegebene Videoformat unterstützen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nema izvora\",\n          \"default\": \"Video nema izvora.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Prekinuto\",\n          \"default\": \"Video je prekinut.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Greška mreže\",\n          \"default\": \"Greška mreže.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Izvorni video ne može biti dekodiran\",\n          \"default\": \"Dekodirajne medija nije moguće.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format videa nije podržan\",\n          \"default\": \"Format videa nije podržan.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Medij zaključan\",\n          \"default\": \"Format videa nije podržan.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nepoznata greška\",\n          \"default\": \"Nepoznata greška.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Netačan YouTube-ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Netačan YouTube-ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nepoznat YouTube-ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Nepoznat YouTube-ID\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ograničen YouTube Video\",\n          \"default\": \"Vlasnik videa je ograničio korištenje istog.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Pristup\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Dodaj video\",\n          \"entity\": \"Video\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Video\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Opis videa\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tip \\\"vrsta\\\", se odnosi na <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Prijevod\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Titlovi\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Opis\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Dio\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Za prijevod se mora navesti izvorni jezik\",\n                \"description\": \"Mora biti ispravan jezički tag BCP 47. Kada \\\"vrsta\\\" odredi vrsta prijevoda, onda se mora izvorni jezik odrediti.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fajl (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(589,32,'ca','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Fonts de vídeo\",\n      \"description\": \"Per assegurar-vos que el vídeo funciona en tots els navegadors, heu d’afegir els orígens en format WebM i MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Elements visuals\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Imatge de pòster\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ajusta el reproductor de vídeo perquè ocupi tot l’espai disponible\",\n          \"description\": \"Si no està establert, el reproductor de vídeo tindrà la mateixa relació d’aspecte que el vídeo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostra els controls del reproductor de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Afegeix controls al reproductor de vídeo. Això permet als usuaris iniciar el vídeo, fer pausa, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Reproducció\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Reprodueix automàticament el vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"El vídeo començarà a reproduir-se automàticament. Pot ser que no funcioni en dispositius mòbils.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Repeteix el vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Torna a iniciar automàticament el vídeo quan acabi.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localització del vídeo\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nom\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Ajuda a identificar el contingut d’aquest estil.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"S’està carregant\",\n          \"default\": \"S’està carregant el reproductor de vídeo...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No s’ha trobat cap reproductor\",\n          \"default\": \"No s’ha trobat cap reproductor de vídeo que admeti el format de vídeo indicat.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Sense orígens\",\n          \"default\": \"El vídeo no disposa d’orígens.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cancel·lada\",\n          \"default\": \"La preproducció multimèdia s’ha cancel·lat.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ha fallat la xarxa\",\n          \"default\": \"Ha fallat la xarxa.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No es pot descodificar l’origen del vídeo\",\n          \"default\": \"No s’ha pogut descodificar el fitxer.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format no admès\",\n          \"default\": \"El format de vídeo no és compatible.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Multimèdia encriptat\",\n          \"default\": \"Contingut encriptat.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Error desconegut\",\n          \"default\": \"Error desconegut.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID de YouTube invàlid\",\n          \"default\": \"ID de YouTube invàlid.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Identificador de YouTube desconegut\",\n          \"default\": \"No es troba el vídeo amb l’identificador de YouTube indicat.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vídeo de YouTube restringit\",\n          \"default\": \"El propietari d’aquest vídeo no permet inserir-lo.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibilitat\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Afegeix una pista de vídeo\",\n          \"entity\": \"Pista\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Pista\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Etiqueta de la pista\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipus; consulteu <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtítols\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Peus de recurs\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descripcions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capítols\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idioma d’origen; cal definir-lo per als subtítols\",\n                \"description\": \"Ha de ser una etiqueta d’idioma BCP 47 vàlida. Si el tipus d’atribut s’estableix en subtítols, cal definir l’atribut srclang.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fitxer de la pista (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(590,32,'cs','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Zdroje videa\",\n      \"description\": \"Chcete-li zajistit, aby video fungovalo ve všech prohlížečích, měli byste přidat zdroje ve formátu WebM a MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Vizuální\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Plakát\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Umístit přehrávač videa tak, aby využíval veškerý dostupný prostor\",\n          \"description\": \"Pokud není nastaven, bude mít přehrávač videa stejný poměr stran jako video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Zobrazit ovládací prvky přehrávače videa\",\n          \"description\": \"Přidejte do přehrávače videa ovládací prvky. To umožňuje uživatelům spustit, pozastavit atd.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Přehrávání\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Automatické přehrávání videa\",\n          \"description\": \"Spustit přehrávání videa automaticky. Na mobilních zařízeních nemusí fungovat.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video ve smyčce\",\n          \"description\": \"Po skončení se video automaticky spustí znovu.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Lokalizace videa\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Název\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Pomáhá identifikovat obsah tohoto typu.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Načítání\",\n          \"default\": \"Načítání video přehrávače...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nebyly nalezeny žádné přehrávače\",\n          \"default\": \"Nebyly nalezeny žádné přehrávače videa, které daný formát videa podporují.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Žádné zdroje\",\n          \"default\": \"Ve videu chybí zdroje.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Selhání\",\n          \"default\": \"Přehrávání médií selhalo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Chyba sítě\",\n          \"default\": \"Chyba sítě.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nelze dekódovat zdroj videa\",\n          \"default\": \"Nelze dekódovat média.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formát není podporován\",\n          \"default\": \"Formát videa není podporován.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Šifrováná média\",\n          \"default\": \"Šifrováná média.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Neznámá chyba\",\n          \"default\": \"Neznámá chyba.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Neplatné ID YouTube\",\n          \"default\": \"Neplatné ID YouTube.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Neznámé YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Video s daným ID YouTube nelze najít.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video YouTube s omezením\",\n          \"default\": \"Vlastník tohoto videa neumožňuje jeho vložení.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Přístupnost\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Přidat video stopu\",\n          \"entity\": \"Stopa\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Stopa\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Popisek stopy\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Typ druhu, viz <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Titulky\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Nadpis\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Popis\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Kapitoly\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Pro titulky musí být definován zdrojový jazyk\",\n                \"description\": \"Musí to být platná jazyková značka BCP 47. Pokud je atribut druh nastaven na titulky, musí být definován srclang.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Sledovat soubor (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(591,32,'da','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video sources\",\n      \"description\": \"To ensure that the video works in all browsers you should add both WebM and MP4 formatted sources.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuals\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Poster image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Fit video player to use all available space\",\n          \"description\": \"If not set the video player will have the same aspect ratio as the video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Show video player controls\",\n          \"description\": \"Add controls to the video player. This allows users to play, pause, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-play video\",\n          \"description\": \"Start playing the video automatically. May not work on mobile devices.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loop video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automatically start the video over again when it ends.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video localization\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Name\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Helps identify content of this type.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loading\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player loading...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No players found\",\n          \"default\": \"Found no video players that supports the given video format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No sources\",\n          \"default\": \"Video is missing sources.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aborted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media playback has been aborted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Network failure\",\n          \"default\": \"Network failure.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cannot decode video source\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to decode media.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format not supported\",\n          \"default\": \"Video format not supported.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media encrypted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media encrypted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown error\",\n          \"default\": \"Unknown error.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Invalid YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Invalid YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Restricted YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibility\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Add video track\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(592,32,'de','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videoquellen\",\n      \"description\": \"Um sicher zu stellen, dass das Video in allen Browsern funktioniert, sollten sowohl Quellen im Format WebM und MP4 hinzugefügt werden.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Darstellung\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vorschaubild\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Den Videoplayer in den verfügbaren Platz einpassen\",\n          \"description\": \"Wird dies nicht ausgewählt, hat der Videoplayer das gleiche Seitenverhältnis wie das Video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Videoplayer-Steuerelemente anzeigen\",\n          \"description\": \"Dies ermöglicht den Lernenden das Abspielen, Pausieren, usw.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Abspielen\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video automatisch abspielen\",\n          \"description\": \"Die Videowiedergabe beginnt nach dem Laden automatisch. Funktioniert auf mobilen Geräten evtl. nicht.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Videoschleife\",\n          \"description\": \"Startet das Video erneut, sobald es vorbei ist.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Übersetzungen der Videobibliothek\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Name\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Hilft dabei, Inhalte dieses Typs als solche zu erkennen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Lädt\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoplayer lädt...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Keine Videoplayer gefunden\",\n          \"default\": \"Keine Videoplayer gefunden, die das vorliegende Videoformat unterstützen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Keine Quellen\",\n          \"default\": \"Es wurden für das Video keine Quellen angegeben.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Abgebrochen\",\n          \"default\": \"Das Abspielen des Videos wurde abgebrochen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Netzwerkfehler\",\n          \"default\": \"Netzwerkfehler.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Videoquelle kann nicht dekodiert werden\",\n          \"default\": \"Dekodierung des Mediums nicht möglich.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format wird nicht unterstützt\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoformat wird nicht unterstützt.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Medium verschlüsselt\",\n          \"default\": \"Medium verschlüsselt.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unbekannter Fehler\",\n          \"default\": \"Unbekannter Fehler.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ungültige YouTube-ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ungültige YouTube-ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unbekannte YouTube-ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Video mit dieser YouTube-ID konnte nicht gefunden werden.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Eingeschränktes YouTube Video\",\n          \"default\": \"Der Besitzer dieses Videos erlaubt kein Einbetten.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Barrierefreiheit\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"(Text-)Spur hinzufügen\",\n          \"entity\": \"Spur\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Spur\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Spurbeschriftung\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Spurart (weitere Informationen im <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>)\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Untertitel (subtitles)\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Untertitel für Hörgeschädigte (captions)\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Beschreibungen für Vorlesewerkzeuge (descriptions)\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Kapitel (chapters)\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Sprache der Spur\",\n                \"description\": \"Muss ein gültiger BCP 47 Sprach-Tag sein. Wenn die Spurart auf \\\"Untertitel (subtitles)\\\" gestellt ist, muss die Sprache definiert werden.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Spurdatei (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(593,32,'el','{\n  \"semantics\":[\n    {\n      \"label\":\"Αρχεία προέλευσης βίντεο\",\n      \"description\":\"Για να διασφαλίσετε ότι το βίντεο λειτουργεί σε όλους τους φυλλομετρητές προσθέστε αρχεία μορφής WebM και MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\":\"Οπτικά στοιχεία\",\n      \"fields\":[\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Αρχική εικόνα\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Προσαρμογή του προγράμματος αναπαραγωγής ώστε να χρησιμοποιεί όλο το διαθέσιμο χώρο\",\n          \"description\":\"Εάν δεν οριστεί, το πρόγραμμα αναπαραγωγής θα έχει την ίδια αναλογία διαστάσεων με το βίντεο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Εμφάνιση κουμπιών προγράμματος αναπαραγωγής\",\n          \"description\":\"Προσθέστε κουμπιά στο πρόγραμμα αναπαραγωγής βίντεο. Αυτό επιτρέπει στους χρήστες να κάνουν αναπαραγωγή (play), παύση (pause) του βίντεο κ.λπ.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\":\"Αναπαραγωγή\",\n      \"fields\":[\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή βίντεο\",\n          \"description\":\"Το βίντεο ξεκινά να παίζει αυτόματα. Ενδέχεται η συγκεκριμένη ρύθμιση να μη λειτουργεί σε φορητές συσκευές.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Αυτόματη επανάληψη αναπαραγωγής\",\n          \"description\":\"Αυτόματη αναπαραγωγή του βίντεο όταν τελειώσει.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\":\"Προσαρμογή\",\n      \"fields\":[\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Όνομα\",\n          \"default\":\"Βίντεο\",\n          \"description\":\"Βοηθά στον προσδιορισμό περιεχομένου αυτού του τύπου.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Φόρτωση\",\n          \"default\":\"Φόρτωση προγράμματος αναπαραγωγής βίντεο...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Δεν βρέθηκαν προγράμματα αναπαραγωγής βίντεο \",\n          \"default\":\"Δεν βρέθηκαν προγράμματα αναπαραγωγής βίντεο που να υποστηρίζουν τη συγκεκριμένη μορφή βίντεο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Δεν υπάρχουν αρχεία προέλευσης\",\n          \"default\":\"Δεν υπάρχουν αρχεία προέλευσης του βίντεο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Διακοπή\",\n          \"default\":\"Διακοπή αναπαραγωγής βίντεο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Αποτυχία δικτύου\",\n          \"default\":\"Αποτυχία δικτύου.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Δεν είναι δυνατή η αποκωδικοποίηση του αρχείου προέλευσης του βίντεο\",\n          \"default\":\"Δεν είναι δυνατή η αποκωδικοποίηση του μέσου.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Μη υποστηριζόμενη μορφή βίντεο\",\n          \"default\":\"Η μορφή του βίντεο δεν υποστηρίζεται.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Κρυπτογραφημένο βίντεο\",\n          \"default\":\"Κρυπτογραφημένο βίντεο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Άγνωστο σφάλμα\",\n          \"default\":\"Άγνωστο σφάλμα.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Μη έγκυρο YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\":\"Το YouTube ID δεν είναι έγκυρο.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Άγνωστο YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\":\"Δεν είναι δυνατή η εύρεση βίντεο με το συγκεκριμένο YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Βίντεο στο YouTube με περιορισμούς\",\n          \"default\":\"Ο κάτοχος αυτού του βίντεο δεν επιτρέπει την ενσωμάτωσή του.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\":\"Προσβασιμότητα\",\n      \"fields\":[\n        {\n          \"label\":\"Προσθήκη βίντεο\",\n          \"entity\":\"βιντεο\",\n          \"field\":{\n            \"label\":\"βίντεο\",\n            \"fields\":[\n              {\n                \"label\":\"Ετικέτα βίντεο\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\":\"Είδος τύπου, βλ. <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\":[\n                  {\n                    \"label\":\"Υπότιτλοι\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\":\"Λεζάντες\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\":\"Περιγραφές\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\":\"Κεφάλαια\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\":\"Γλώσσα προέλευσης, πρέπει να προσδιοριστεί για υποτίτλους\",\n                \"description\":\"Πρέπει να είναι έγκυρη ετικέτα γλώσσας BCP 47. Εάν οι \\\"Υπότιτλοι\\\" είναι ο επιλεγμένος τύπος, πρέπει να οριστεί η γλώσσα προέλευσης.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\":\"Αρχείο προέλευσης (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(594,32,'es','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Fuentes de Vídeo\",\n      \"description\": \"Para asegurar que los videos funcionen en todos los navegadores usted debería añadir tanto fuentes formateados en WebM y MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuales\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Imagen de cartel\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Se ajusta el reproductor de vídeo para usar todo el espacio disponible\",\n          \"description\": \"Si no se configura, el reproductor de vídeo tendrá la misma proporción de aspecto que el vídeo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostrar controles del reproductor de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Añadir controles al reproductor de vídeo. Esto le permite a los usuarios el reproducir, pausar, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Reproducción\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-reproducir vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Comenzar a reproducir el vídeo automáticamente. Podría no funcionar en dispositivos móviles.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Bucle de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Automáticamente iniciar el vídeo una y otra vez cuando se termine.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localización del Vídeo\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nombre\",\n          \"default\": \"Vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Ayuda a identificar el contenido de este tipo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cargando\",\n          \"default\": \"Reproductor de Vídeo cargando...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No se encontraron reproductores\",\n          \"default\": \"No se encontraron reproductores de video que soporten el formato dado de vídeo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No hay orígenes (fuentes)\",\n          \"default\": \"Faltan fuentes de vídeo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Abortado\",\n          \"default\": \"El reproductor de medios ha sido abortado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Falla de la red\",\n          \"default\": \"Falla de la red.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No se puede decodificar la fuente de video\",\n          \"default\": \"No se puede decodificar los medios.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formato no soportado\",\n          \"default\": \"Formato de vídeo no soportado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Medio encriptado\",\n          \"default\": \"Medio encriptado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Error desconocido\",\n          \"default\": \"Error desconocido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID de YouTube inválida\",\n          \"default\": \"ID de YouTube inválida.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID de YouTube desconocida\",\n          \"default\": \"No se puede encontrar vídeo con la ID de YouTube dada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vídeo YouTube Restringido\",\n          \"default\": \"El propietario de este vídeo no permite que sea incrustado.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accesibilidad\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Añadir pista de audio\",\n          \"entity\": \"Pista\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Pista\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Etiqueta de pista\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipo, refiérase a <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtítulos\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Letreritos\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descripciones\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capítulos\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idioma de la fuente, debe estar definido para los subtítulos\",\n                \"description\": \"Debe ser una marca (tag) de idioma BCP 47 válida. Si el tipo de atributo está configurado a subtítulos, entonces srclang debe estar definido.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Archivo de pista (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(595,32,'es-mx','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Fuentes de Video\",\n      \"description\": \"Para asegurar que los videos funcionen en todos los navegadores usted debería añadir tanto fuentes formateados en WebM y MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuales\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Imagen de cartel\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Se ajusta el reproductor de video para usar todo el espacio disponible\",\n          \"description\": \"Si no se configura, el reproductor de video tendrá la misma proporción de aspecto que el video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostrar controles del reproductor de video\",\n          \"description\": \"Añadir controles al reproductor de video. Esto le permite a los usuarios el reproducir, pausar, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Reproducción\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-reproducir video\",\n          \"description\": \"Comenzar a reproducir el video automáticamente. Podría no funcionar en dispositivos móviles.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Bucle de video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automáticamente iniciar el video una y otra vez cuando se termine.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localización del Video\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nombre\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Ayuda a identificar el contenido de este tipo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cargando\",\n          \"default\": \"Reproductor de Video cargando...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No se encontraron reproductores\",\n          \"default\": \"No se encontraron reproductores de video que soporten el formato dado de video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No hay orígenes (fuentes)\",\n          \"default\": \"Faltan fuentes de video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Abortado\",\n          \"default\": \"El reproductor de medios ha sido abortado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Falla de la red\",\n          \"default\": \"Falla de la red.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No se puede decodificar la fuente de video\",\n          \"default\": \"No se pueden decodificar los medios.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formato no soportado\",\n          \"default\": \"Formato de video no soportado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Medio encriptado\",\n          \"default\": \"Medio encriptado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Error desconocido\",\n          \"default\": \"Error desconocido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID de YouTube inválida\",\n          \"default\": \"ID de YouTube inválida.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID de YouTube desconocida\",\n          \"default\": \"No se puede encontrar video con la ID de YouTube dada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video YouTube restringido\",\n          \"default\": \"El propietario de este video no permite que sea incrustado.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accesibilidad\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Añadir pista de audio\",\n          \"entity\": \"Pista\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Pista\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Etiqueta de pista\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipo, refiérase a <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtítulos\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Letreritos\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descripciones\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capítulos\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idioma de la fuente, debe estar definido para los subtítulos\",\n                \"description\": \"Debe ser una marca (tag) de idioma BCP 47 válida. Si el tipo de atributo está configurado a subtítulos, entonces srclang debe estar definido.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Archivo de pista (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(596,32,'et','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video allikad\",\n      \"description\": \"Tagamaks, et video töötab kõigis brausereid, tuleks video lisada nii WebM kui ka MP4 formaadis.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuaalid\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Postripilt\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Täida videomängijaga kogu võimalik ala\",\n          \"description\": \"Kui ei ole märgitud, siis videomängija järgib sama kuvasuhet, mis on videol.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Näita videomängija juhtnuppe\",\n          \"description\": \"Lisa videomängijale juhtnupud. Nii saab kasutaja videot mängima panna, pausida jne.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Taasesitus\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video automaatne mängimine\",\n          \"description\": \"Alustab video mängimist automaatselt. Ei pruugi töötada mobiilseadmeis.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Esita videot korduses\",\n          \"description\": \"Käivita video lõppu jõudmisel automaatselt uuesti.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video kohandamine\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nimi\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Aitab määrata selle tüübi sisu.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Laadimine\",\n          \"default\": \"Videomängija laadib...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Videomängijaid ei leitud\",\n          \"default\": \"Ei leitud antud videoformaati toetavaid videomängijaid.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Allikaid ei ole\",\n          \"default\": \"Lähtevideo puudub.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Katkestatud\",\n          \"default\": \"Meedia taasesitus on katkestatud.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Võrgu viga\",\n          \"default\": \"Võrgu viga.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ei saa lähtevideot dekodeerida\",\n          \"default\": \"Ei saa meediat dekodeerida.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formaat ei ole toetatud\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoformaat ei ole toetatud.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Krüpteeritud meedia\",\n          \"default\": \"Meedia on krüpteeritud.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tundmatu viga\",\n          \"default\": \"Tundmatu viga.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mittetoimiv YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Mittetoimiv YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tundmatu YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ei leia antud YouTube ID-le vastavat videot.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Piiratud õigustega YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"Selle video omanik ei luba videot esitada teistel lehtedel.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Vaegkasutus\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Lisa videoriba\",\n          \"entity\": \"Riba\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Riba\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Riba silt\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Liik, viide: <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\"> HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtiitrid\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Tiitrid\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Kirjeldused\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Pealkirjad\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Algkeel, peab olema määratletud subtiitride puhul\",\n                \"description\": \"Peab olema kehtiv BCP 47 keelesilt. Kui liigi-atribuut on seatud subtiitriks, siis peab srclang olema määratud.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Ribafail (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(597,32,'eu','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Bideo-iturriak\",\n      \"description\": \"Bideoa nabigatzaile guztietan ondo ikusiko dela ziurtatzeko WebM eta MP4 formatuetan igo beharko duzu.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Bisualak\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Poster-irudia\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Doitu bideo-erreproduzigailua erabil daitekeen espazio osoa har dezan\",\n          \"description\": \"Ezarri ezean bideo-erreproduzigailuak bideoaren ratio bera izango du.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erakutsi bideo-irakurgailuaren kontrolak\",\n          \"description\": \"Gehitu kontrolak bideo-erreproduzigailuari. Horrek erabiltzaileen esku hainbat kontrol jarriko ditu, hala nola, hasi, gelditu, etab.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Erreprodukzioa\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erreproduzitu bideoa automatikoki\",\n          \"description\": \"Hasi bideoa automatikoki erreproduzitzen. Baliteke sakelako telefonoetan ez funtzionatzea.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Etenik gabeko erreprodukzioa\",\n          \"description\": \"Hasi bideoa berriro automatikoki amaitutakoan.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Bideoaren lokalizazioa\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Izenburua\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideoa\",\n          \"description\": \"Era honetako edukia identifikatzen laguntzen du.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kargatzen\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideo-erreproduzigailua kargatzen ari da...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ez da erreproduzigailurik aurkitu\",\n          \"default\": \"Emandako bideo-formatua onartzen duen erreproduzigailurik ez da aurkitu.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Iturririk ez\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideoak ez du iturririk.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Utzia\",\n          \"default\": \"Erreprodukzioa gelditu da.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Sare-errorea\",\n          \"default\": \"Sare-erroreea.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ezin da bideoa deskodetu\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideoa deskodetzea ezinezkoa da.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formatua ez da onartzen\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideo-formatua ez da onartzen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Multimedia enkriptatua\",\n          \"default\": \"Multimedia enkriptatua.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Errore ezezaguna\",\n          \"default\": \"Errore ezezaguna.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"YouTube ID baliogabea\",\n          \"default\": \"YouTube ID baliogabea.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"YouTube ID ezezaguna\",\n          \"default\": \"Ez da aurkitu YouTube ID hori duen bideorik.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"YouTube bideo mugatu\",\n          \"default\": \"Bideo honen jabeak ez du kapsulatzerik onartzen.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Erabilerraztasuna\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Gehitu bideo-pista\",\n          \"entity\": \"Pista\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Pista\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Pistaren etiketa\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idatzi mota, jo ezazu <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML estandarrera</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Azpitituluak\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Azpitituluak\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Deskribapena\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Kapituluak\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Jatorrizko hizkuntza, azpitituluetarako definitu behar dena\",\n                \"description\": \"BCP 47 hizkuntza-etiketa baliogarria izan behar du. Atributuan azpitituluak ezarri badira, srclang definitu beharra dago.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Pista-fitxategia (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(598,32,'fi','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videolähteet\",\n      \"description\": \"Varmistaaksesi toimivuuden eri selaimissa lataa vähintään mp4- ja webm-versiot videosta.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Ulkoasu\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Esittelykuva\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Sovita videosoitin kehykseen\",\n          \"description\": \"Jos ei ole valittuna, niin videosoitin säilyttää videon kuvasuhteen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Näytä videon ohjaimet\",\n          \"description\": \"Lisää ohjaimet soittimeen. Mahdollistaa käynnistyksen, keskeytyksen jne...\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Toisto\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Käynnistä video automaattisesti\",\n          \"description\": \"Käynnistä video automaattisesti. Ei ehkä toimi mobiililaitteilla.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Toista videota\",\n          \"description\": \"Aloittaa videon lopttua sen alusta aina uudestaan.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Omat tekstit\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nimi\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Auttaa tunnistamaan tämän sisältötyypin.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Lataa\",\n          \"default\": \"Lataa soitinta...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Soittimia ei löytynyt\",\n          \"default\": \"Ei löytänyt soveltuvaa soitinta videomuodolle.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ei lähteitä\",\n          \"default\": \"Videolta puuttuu lähde.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Keskeytetty\",\n          \"default\": \"Median esitys keskeytetty.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Verkkovirhe\",\n          \"default\": \"Verkkovirhe.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Videolähdettä ei saatu purettua\",\n          \"default\": \"Mediaa ei saatu purettua.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Muotoa ei tueta\",\n          \"default\": \"Videomuotoa ei tueta.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media on salattu\",\n          \"default\": \"Media on salattu.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tuntematon virhe\",\n          \"default\": \"Tuntematon virhe.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Epäkelpo YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Epäkelpo YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tuntematon YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"YouTube ID ei vastaa yhtään videota.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rajoitettu YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"Videon omistaja ei salli sen upottamista.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Esteettömyys\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Lisää raita\",\n          \"entity\": \"Raita\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Raita\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Raidan selite\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tyyppi, lisätietoa <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Tekstitykset\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Otsikot\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Selitteet\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Kappaleet\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Lähdekieli, pakollinen tekstityksille\",\n                \"description\": \"Täytyy olla BCP 47 -muotoinen, esimerkiksi en,fi,es,sv... Jos Tekstitykset on valittu tekstiraidan tyypiksi, on lähdekieli määriteltävä.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Raidan lähde (WebVTT tiedosto)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(599,32,'fr','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Sources vidéo\",\n      \"description\": \"Selectionnez les fichiers vidéo que vous souhaitez utiliser. Pour assurer une compatibilité maximum avec les navigateurs, merci d\'utiliser des vidéos au format mp4 ou webm.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuels\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Image à la une\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Le lecteur vidéo utilise toute la place disponible\",\n          \"description\": \"Si non précisé, le lecteur aura la même taille que la vidéo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Montrer les boutons de contrôle de la vidéo\",\n          \"description\": \"Montre les boutons de contrôle de la vidéo : lecture, pause...\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Démarrage automatique\",\n          \"description\": \"La vidéo démarre automatiquement. Peut ne pas fonctionner sur certains appareils mobiles.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rejouer la vidéo\",\n          \"description\": \"La vidéo est rejouée quand elle est terminée.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localisation de la vidéo\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nom\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Aide à identifier le type de contenu.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Chargement\",\n          \"default\": \"Chargement du lecteur vidéo...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aucun lecteur vidéo trouvé\",\n          \"default\": \"Aucun lecteur vidéo trouvé pour supporter le format video utilisé.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aucune source vidéo\",\n          \"default\": \"La vidéo n\'a pas de source associée.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Abandonné\",\n          \"default\": \"La lecture du média a été abandonnée.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erreur de réseau\",\n          \"default\": \"Problème de connexion au réseau.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Impossible de décoder la vidéo\",\n          \"default\": \"Impossible de décoder la vidéo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format vidéo non supporté\",\n          \"default\": \"Format vidéo non supporté.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vidéo cryptée\",\n          \"default\": \"Vidéo cryptée.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erreur inconnue\",\n          \"default\": \"Erreur inconnue.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID YouTube invalide\",\n          \"default\": \"Identifiant YouTube invalide.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID YouTube inconnue\",\n          \"default\": \"Impossible de trouver la vidéo avec cet identifiant YouTube.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vidéo YouTube à accès restreint\",\n          \"default\": \"Le propriétaire de cette vidéo n\'autorise pas son inclusion.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibilité\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ajouter une piste vidéo\",\n          \"entity\": \"Piste\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Piste\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Intitulé de la piste\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type de piste, voir <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">standard HTML actuel</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Sous-titres\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Audio description\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapitres\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fichier de la piste (format WebVTT)\",\n                \"description\": \"Doit être un code langage conforme à la norme BCP 47. Si le type de piste est défini à \\\"Sous-titres\\\", alors la langue doit être définie.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fichier de la piste (format WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(600,32,'he','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"מקורות וידאו\",\n      \"description\": \"כדי שסרטון זה יפעל בכל הדפדפנים יש להוסיף את המקורות בשני הפורמטים WebM, MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"חזותיים\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תמונת פתיח\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"התאמת נגן הוידאו כך שישתמש בכל השטח הזמין\",\n          \"description\": \"אם לא הוגדר, לנגן הווידאו יהיה יחס גובה-רוחב זהה לזה של הסרטון.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תצוגת סרגל כפתורי הוידאו\",\n          \"description\": \"הוספת פקדים לנגן הווידאו. זה מאפשר למשתמשים לנגן את הסרטון, להשהות וכו.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"צפיה־חוזרת\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"הפעלה אוטומטית של הוידאו\",\n          \"description\": \"הפעלת הסרטון באופן אוטומטי. ייתכן שלא יפעל במכשירים ניידים.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תצוגה מחזורית של הוידאו\",\n          \"description\": \"הפעלת הסרטון שוב באופן אוטומטי כאשר הוא מסתיים.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"תרגום וידאו מקומי\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"שם\",\n          \"default\": \"וידאו\",\n          \"description\": \"עוזר לזהות תוכן מסוג זה.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"נטען\",\n          \"default\": \"נגן הוידאו עולה...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"לא נמצא נגן מתאים לסרטון מסוג זה\",\n          \"default\": \"לא נמצא נגן וידאו התומך בפורמט הסרטון.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"לא קיימים מקורות וידאו\",\n          \"default\": \"חסרים מקורות וידאו לסרטון.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"בוטל\",\n          \"default\": \"הפעלת המדיה בוטלה.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תקלת רשת\",\n          \"default\": \"תקלת רשת.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"לא ניתן לפענח את מקור הסרטון\",\n          \"default\": \"לא ניתן לפענח את המדיה.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תסדיר הוידאו לא נתמך\",\n          \"default\": \"תסדיר הוידאו לא נתמך.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"סרטון מוצפן\",\n          \"default\": \"הסרטון מוצפן.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"תקלה לא ברורה\",\n          \"default\": \"תקלה לא ברורה.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"קוד סרטון יוטיוב שגוי\",\n          \"default\": \"קוד סרטון יוטיוב שגוי.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"קוד סרטון יוטיוב שגוי\",\n          \"default\": \"לא ניתן למצוא סרטון עם YouTube ID זה.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"סרטון יוטיוב מוגבל\",\n          \"default\": \"הבעלים של סרטון זה אינו מאפשר את הטמעתו.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"נגישות\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"הוספת ערוץ וידאו\",\n          \"entity\": \"ערוץ\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"ערוץ\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"תווית הערוץ\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"כתוביות\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"כתוביות + תאור התרחשות\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"תיאור\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"פרקים\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"שפת המקור חייבת להיות מוגדרת לשם הצגת כתוביות\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"קובץ כתוביות (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(601,32,'hu','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video sources\",\n      \"description\": \"To ensure that the video works in all browsers you should add both WebM and MP4 formatted sources.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuals\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Poster image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Fit video player to use all available space\",\n          \"description\": \"If not set the video player will have the same aspect ratio as the video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Show video player controls\",\n          \"description\": \"Add controls to the video player. This allows users to play, pause, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-play video\",\n          \"description\": \"Start playing the video automatically. May not work on mobile devices.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loop video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automatically start the video over again when it ends.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video localization\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Name\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Helps identify content of this type.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loading\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player loading...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No players found\",\n          \"default\": \"Found no video players that supports the given video format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No sources\",\n          \"default\": \"Video is missing sources.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aborted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media playback has been aborted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Network failure\",\n          \"default\": \"Network failure.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cannot decode video source\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to decode media.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format not supported\",\n          \"default\": \"Video format not supported.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media encrypted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media encrypted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown error\",\n          \"default\": \"Unknown error.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Invalid YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Invalid YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Restricted YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibility\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Add video track\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(602,32,'it','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Sorgenti video\",\n      \"description\": \"Per assicurarsi che il video sia riproducibile su tutti i browser si dovrebbero aggiungere sia WebM sia MP4 come sorgenti di formattazione\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Effetti visivi\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Immagine popup\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Adatta il video player per utilizzare tutto lo spazio disponibile\",\n          \"description\": \"Se non è impostato, il lettore video avrà le stesse proporzioni del video\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostra controlli del video player\",\n          \"description\": \"Aggiungi controlli al video player. Questo consente agli utenti di premere avvio, pausa ecc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Riproduzione automatica del video\",\n          \"description\": \"Avvia la riproduzione video automaticamente. Potrebbe non funzionare sui dispositivi mobili\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ripeti video\",\n          \"description\": \"Riavvia automaticamente il video dopo che è finito\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localizzazione del video\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nome\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Aiuta a identificare contenuto di questo tipo\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Caricamento\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player in caricamento...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nessun player trovato\",\n          \"default\": \"Impossibile trovare dei video player che supportino quel formato video\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nessun sorgente\",\n          \"default\": \"Mancano i sorgenti del video\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Terminato\",\n          \"default\": \"La riproduzione multimediale è stata interrotta\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Errore di rete\",\n          \"default\": \"Errore di rete\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Impossibile decodificare il sorgente video\",\n          \"default\": \"Impossibile decodificare il supporto\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formato non supportato\",\n          \"default\": \"Formato video non supportato\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media criptato\",\n          \"default\": \"Media criptato\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Errore sconosciuto\",\n          \"default\": \"Errore sconosciuto\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID YouTube non valido\",\n          \"default\": \"ID YouTube non valido\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID YouTube sconosciuto\",\n          \"default\": \"Impossibile trovare un video con quell\'ID YouTube\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Video YouTube a riproduzione riservata\",\n          \"default\": \"Il proprietario di questo video non ne permette l\'incorporazione\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibilità\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aggiungi traccia video\",\n          \"entity\": \"Traccia\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Traccia\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Etichetta della traccia\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Digita \\\"kind\\\". Fai riferimento a <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Sottotitoli\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Didascalie\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descrizioni\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capitoli\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"File di traccia (WebVTT)\",\n                \"description\": \"Dev\'essere un tag di lingua valido BCP 47. Se l\'attributo \\\"kind\\\" è impostato su sottotitoli, allora \\\"srclang\\\" dev\'essere definito\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"File di traccia (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(603,32,'ja','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"ビデオソース\",\n      \"description\": \"ビデオがすべてのブラウザで動作するようにするには、WebMとMP4の両方の形式のソースを追加する必要があります。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"外観\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ポスター画像\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"利用可能なすべてのスペースを使用するようにビデオプレーヤーを合わせる\",\n          \"description\": \"設定されていない場合、ビデオプレイヤーのアスペクト比はビデオと同じになります。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ビデオプレーヤのコントロールを表示します。\",\n          \"description\": \"ビデオプレーヤーにコントロールを追加します。 これにより、ユーザーは再生、一時停止などが可能になります。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"再生\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ビデオの自動再生\",\n          \"description\": \"自動的にビデオの再生を開始します。 モバイルデバイスでは動作しない可能性があります。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ビデオをループ\",\n          \"description\": \"ビデオが終了すると自動的にビデオを再び開始します。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"ビデオローカリゼーション\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"名前\",\n          \"default\": \"ビデオ\",\n          \"description\": \"このタイプのコンテンツを識別するのに役立ちます。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"読み込み中\",\n          \"default\": \"ビデオプレーヤーの読み込み中...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"プレイヤーが見つかりませんでした\",\n          \"default\": \"指定されたビデオ形式をサポートするビデオプレーヤーが見つかりませんでした。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ソース無し\",\n          \"default\": \"ビデオにソースがありません。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"中止しました\",\n          \"default\": \"メディアの再生が中止されました。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ネットワーク障害\",\n          \"default\": \"ネットワーク障害\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ビデオソースをでコードできません\",\n          \"default\": \"メディアをデコードできないようにする\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"この形式に対応していません\",\n          \"default\": \"このビデオ形式に対応していません。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"メディア暗号化\",\n          \"default\": \"メディア暗号化\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"不明なエラー\",\n          \"default\": \"不明なエラー\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"無効なYouTube ID。\",\n          \"default\": \"無効なYouTube ID。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"不明な YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"指定された YouTube ID でビデオを見つけることができません。\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"制限された YouTube のビデオ\",\n          \"default\": \"このビデオの所有者は、埋め込むことを許可していません。\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"アクセシビリティ\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ビデオ トラックを追加\",\n          \"entity\": \"トラック\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"トラック\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"トラックラベル\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"種類を入力してください。<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\"> HTML living standard</a> を参照。\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"字幕\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"キャプション\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"説明\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"章\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"字幕のソース言語を定義する必要があります。\",\n                \"description\": \"有効な BCP 47 言語タグでなければなりません。kind 属性に subtitles を設定した場合は、srclang 属性を定義しなければなりません。\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"トラックファイル (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(604,32,'km','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"ប្រភពវីដេអូ\",\n      \"description\": \"ដើម្បីធានាថាវីដេអូរបស់អ្នកនឹងដំណើរការលើគ្រប់កម្មវិធីបើកវិបសាយ អ្នកគួរបញ្ចូលវីដេអូទាំងប្រភេទ WebM និង MP4។\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"រូបរាង\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"រូបភាពក្រប\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ដាក់វីដេអូឲ្យសមនឹងទំហំទីតាំងដែលមាន\",\n          \"description\": \"ប្រសិនបើមិនកំណត់បែបនេះទេ វីដេអូនឹងបង្ហាញទៅតាមទំហំដើមរបស់វា។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"បង្ហាញប៊ូតុងបញ្ជាវីដេអូ\",\n          \"description\": \"បង្ហាញប៊ូតុងបញ្ជានៅលើកម្មវិធីចាក់វីដេអូ ដើម្បីឲ្យគេអាចលេង ផ្អាក ។ល។\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"របៀបចាក់វីដេអូ\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"លេងវីដេអូដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ\",\n          \"description\": \"ចាប់ផ្តើមលេងវីដេអូដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ។ អាចនឹងមិនដំណើរការនៅលើឧបករណ៍ចល័ត។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"លេងឡើងវិញ\",\n          \"description\": \"លេងវីដេអូដដែលៗដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"បកប្រែ «វីដេអូ\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ឈ្មោះ\",\n          \"default\": \"វីដេអូ\",\n          \"description\": \"ជួយសម្គាល់មាតិកាប្រភេទនេះ\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"កំពុងដំណើរការ\",\n          \"default\": \"កម្មវិធីលេងវីដេអូកំពុងដំណើរការ...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"អត់មានកម្មវិធីចាក់វីដេអូ\",\n          \"default\": \"រកមិនឃើញកម្មវិធីដែលអាចលេងប្រភេទវីដេអូដែលបានបញ្ចូល។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"អត់មានវីដេអូ\",\n          \"default\": \"មិនមានឯកសារវីដេអូ\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ត្រូវបានបោះបង់\",\n          \"default\": \"ការលេងមេឌាត្រូវបានបោះបង់។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"បណ្តាញបរាជ័យ\",\n          \"default\": \"បណ្តាញបរាជ័យ\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"មិនអាចបម្លែងមេឌាបាន\",\n          \"default\": \"មិនអាចបម្លែងមេឌាបាន\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ប្រភេទវីដេអូមិនត្រូវបានគាំទ្រ\",\n          \"default\": \"ប្រភេទវីដេអូមិនត្រូវបានគាំទ្រ\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"មេឌាត្រូវបានអ៊ីនគ្រីប\",\n          \"default\": \"មេឌាត្រូវបានអ៊ីនគ្រីប\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"មិនដឹងមានបញ្ហាអី\",\n          \"default\": \"មិនដឹងមានបញ្ហាអី\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID យូធូបមិនត្រឹមត្រូវ។\",\n          \"default\": \"ID យូធូបមិនត្រឹមត្រូវ។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"អត់ស្គាល់ YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"រកមិនឃើញវីដេអូដែលត្រូវ ID ដែលបានបញ្ចូល។\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"វីដេអូ YouTube មានកំហិត\",\n          \"default\": \"ម្ចាស់វីដេអូនេះមិនអនុញ្ញាតឲ្យគេបង្កប់វីដេអូនេះក្នុងវេបសាយក្រៅពី YouTube ទេ។\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibility\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Add video track\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(605,32,'ko','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"비디오 소스\",\n      \"description\": \"비디오가 모든 브라우저에서 작동하도록 하려면 WebM과 MP4 형식 소스를 모두 추가하십시오.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"시각화\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"포스터 이미지\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"비디오 플레이어가 사용 가능한 모든 공간을 사용할 수 있도록 맞추기\",\n          \"description\": \"설정하지 않으면 비디오 플레이어의 가로 세로 비율이 비디오와 같습니다.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"비디오 플레이어 컨트롤 표시\",\n          \"description\": \"비디오 플레이어에 컨트롤을 추가하여 사용자는 재생, 일시정지 등을 할 수 있다.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"재생\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"비디오 자동 재생\",\n          \"description\": \"비디오 자동 재생을 시작합니다. 모바일 장치에서는 작동하지 않을 수 있음.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"반복 재생\",\n          \"description\": \"영상이 끝나면 자동으로 다시 시작\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"맞춤형 설정\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"이름\",\n          \"default\": \"비디오\",\n          \"description\": \"이 유형의 콘텐츠를 식별하는 데 도움이 됨.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"로딩중\",\n          \"default\": \"비디오 재생기 로딩중...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"재생기가 없음\",\n          \"default\": \"주어진 비디오 형식을 지원하는 비디오 플레이어를 찾을 수 없음.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"소스 누락\",\n          \"default\": \"비디오가 소스가 없습니다.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"중단\",\n          \"default\": \"미디어 재생이 중단됨.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"네트워크 장애\",\n          \"default\": \"네트워크 장애.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"비디오 소스를 디코딩할 수 없음\",\n          \"default\": \"매체를 디코딩할 수 없음.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"포맷이 지원되지 않음\",\n          \"default\": \"비디오 형식이 지원되지 않음.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"미디어 암호화\",\n          \"default\": \"암호화된 미디어.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"알 수 없는 오류\",\n          \"default\": \"알 수 없는 오류.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"잘못된 YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"잘못된 YouTube ID\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"알 수 없는 유튜브 아이디\",\n          \"default\": \"주어진 YouTube 아이디로 동영상을 찾을 수 없음.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"제한된 유튜브 동영상\",\n          \"default\": \"이 동영상의 소유자는 이 동영상이 삽입되는 것을 허용하지 않습니다.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"접근서\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"비디오 트랙 추가\",\n          \"entity\": \"트랙\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"트랙\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"트랙 라벨\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"타입 종류, 참조, <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"자막\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"캡션\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"설명\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"챕터\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"소스언어가 자막을 위해 정의되어야 합니다.\",\n                \"description\": \"유효한 BCP 47 언어 태그가 되어야 한다. 종류 속성이 자막으로 설정되면 srclang 가 정의되어야 한다.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"트랙파일 (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(606,32,'nb','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videofiler\",\n      \"description\": \"Formater som støttes er webm, mp4 og ogv.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuelle egenskaper\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Plakat\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tilpass størrelse\",\n          \"description\": \"Forstørr og forminsk avhengig av tilgjengelig størrelse\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Slå på kontroller\",\n          \"description\": \"Kontrollene lar bl.a. brukeren sette videoavspillingen på pause\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Avspilling\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Slå på automatisk avspilling\",\n          \"description\": \"Med automatisk avspilling begynner videoen å spille av seg selv med en gang. Hvis automatisk avspilling er avslått må brukeren klikke for å starte avspillingen. Merk at automatisk avspilling ikke virker på mobile enheter.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Automatisk omstart\",\n          \"description\": \"Start videoen på nytt når avspillingen er ferdig.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Lokalisering av video\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Navn\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Hjelper med å identifisere innholdstypen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Laster\",\n          \"default\": \"Videospilleren laster...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ingen avspillere funnet\",\n          \"default\": \"Fant ingen videoavspillere som støtter gjeldene format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ingen kilde\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoavspilleren mangler kilde.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Avbrutt\",\n          \"default\": \"Avspillingen ble avbrutt.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nettverksfeil\",\n          \"default\": \"Nettverksfeil\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kan ikke dekode videokilde\",\n          \"default\": \"Kan ikke dekode videokilde.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format støttes ikke\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoformatet støttes ikke.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kryptert media\",\n          \"default\": \"Kilden er kryptert.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ukjent feil\",\n          \"default\": \"Ukjent feil.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ugyldig YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ugyldig YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ukjent YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Finner ikke videoen med gitt YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Begrensen tilgang til YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"Eieren av denne videoen tillater ikke at den bygges inn på andre nettsider.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tilgjengelighet\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Legg til spor\",\n          \"entity\": \"Spor\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(607,32,'nl','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videobronnen\",\n      \"description\": \"Om ervoor te zorgen dat video in alle browsers werkt, moet u zowel WebM als MP4 opgemaakte bronnen toevoegen.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visueel\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Poster afbeelding\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Laat video player alle beschikbare ruimte gebruiken\",\n          \"description\": \"ALs dit niet is ingesteld, gebruikt de video player dezelfde afmetingen als de video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Toon video player controleknoppen\",\n          \"description\": \"Voeg controleknoppen aan de video player toe. Dit staat gebruikers toe af te spelen, pauzeren, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-play video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automatisch starten met afspelen van de video. Werkt mogelijk niet op mobiele apparaten.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loop video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automatisch de video opnieuw starten wanneer die afgelopen is.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video localization\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Naam\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Helpt inhoud van dit type te herkennen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Laden\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player aan het laden...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Geen players gevonden\",\n          \"default\": \"Geen video players gevonden die de gegeven video-opmaak ondersteunen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Geen bronnen\",\n          \"default\": \"Video bevat geen bronnen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Afgebroken\",\n          \"default\": \"Media playback is afgebroken.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Netwerkfout\",\n          \"default\": \"Netwerkfout.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kan videobron niet decoderen\",\n          \"default\": \"Niet mogelijk om media te decoderen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Opmaak niet ondersteund\",\n          \"default\": \"Video-opmaak niet ondersteund.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media versleuteld\",\n          \"default\": \"Media versleuteld.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onbekende fout\",\n          \"default\": \"Onbekende fout.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ongeldige YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ongeldige YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Onbekende YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Niet mogelijk de video met de opgegeven YouTube ID te vinden.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Afgeschermde YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"De eigenaar van deze video staat insluiten van deze video niet toe.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Toegankelijkheid\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Voeg video track toe\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type soort, verwijst naar <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Ondertitels\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Bijschriften\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Beschrijvingen\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Hoofdstukken\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Bron taal, moet worden opgegeven voor ondertitels\",\n                \"description\": \"Moet een geldige BCP 47 taal tag zijn. Als de soort-attribuut is ingesteld op ondertitels, dan moet srclang worden vastgelegd.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track bestand (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(608,32,'nn','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Videofiler\",\n      \"description\": \"Format som støttast er webm, mp4 og ogv.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuelt\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Plakat\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Tilpass størrelse\",\n          \"description\": \"Forstørr og forminsk avhengig av tilgjengeleg størrelse\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Slå på kontrollar\",\n          \"description\": \"Kontrollane lar mellom anna brukaren setje videoavspelinga på pause\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Avspilling\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Slå på automatisk avspeling\",\n          \"description\": \"Med automatisk avspeling startar videoen å spele av seg sjølv med ein gong. Viss automatisk avspeling er slått av må brukaren trykkje for å starte avspelinga. Merk at automatisk avspeling ikkje virkar på mobile einingar.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Automatisk omstart\",\n          \"description\": \"Start videoen på nytt når avspillingen er ferdig.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Lokalisering av video\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Navn\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Hjelper med å identifisere innholdstypen.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Laster\",\n          \"default\": \"Videospilleren laster...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ingen avspillere funnet\",\n          \"default\": \"Fant ingen videoavspillere som støtter gjeldene format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ingen kilde\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoavspilleren mangler kilde.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Avbrutt\",\n          \"default\": \"Avspillingen ble avbrutt.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nettverksfeil\",\n          \"default\": \"Nettverksfeil\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kan ikke dekode videokilde\",\n          \"default\": \"Kan ikke dekode videokilde.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format støttes ikke\",\n          \"default\": \"Videoformatet støttes ikke.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Kryptert media\",\n          \"default\": \"Kilden er kryptert.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ukjent feil\",\n          \"default\": \"Ukjent feil.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ugyldig YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Ugyldig YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ugyldig YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Finner ikke videoen med gitt YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Begrensen tilgang til YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"Eieren av denne videoen tillater ikke at den bygges inn på andre nettsider.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tilgjengelighet\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Legg til spor\",\n          \"entity\": \"Spor\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(609,32,'pl','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video sources\",\n      \"description\": \"To ensure that the video works in all browsers you should add both WebM and MP4 formatted sources.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuals\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Poster image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Fit video player to use all available space\",\n          \"description\": \"If not set the video player will have the same aspect ratio as the video.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Show video player controls\",\n          \"description\": \"Add controls to the video player. This allows users to play, pause, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Playback\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Auto-play video\",\n          \"description\": \"Start playing the video automatically. May not work on mobile devices.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loop video\",\n          \"description\": \"Automatically start the video over again when it ends.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Video localization\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Name\",\n          \"default\": \"Video\",\n          \"description\": \"Helps identify content of this type.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Loading\",\n          \"default\": \"Video player loading...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No players found\",\n          \"default\": \"Found no video players that supports the given video format.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"No sources\",\n          \"default\": \"Video is missing sources.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Aborted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media playback has been aborted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Network failure\",\n          \"default\": \"Network failure.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cannot decode video source\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to decode media.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Format not supported\",\n          \"default\": \"Video format not supported.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Media encrypted\",\n          \"default\": \"Media encrypted.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown error\",\n          \"default\": \"Unknown error.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Invalid YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Invalid YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Unknown YouTube ID\",\n          \"default\": \"Unable to find video with the given YouTube ID.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Restricted YouTube video\",\n          \"default\": \"The owner of this video does not allow it to be embedded.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Accessibility\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Add video track\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Track\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track label\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Type kind, refer to <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Subtitles\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Captions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descriptions\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Chapters\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Source language, must be defined for subtitles\",\n                \"description\": \"Must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. If the kind attribute is set to subtitles, then srclang must be defined.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Track file (WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(610,32,'pt-br','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Arquivos de vídeo\",\n      \"description\": \"Para se assegurar que todos os navegadores suportem o vídeo, você deve fazer upload de ambos formatos WebM e MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuais\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Imagem de cartaz\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Encaixar o reprodutor de vídeo para ocupar todo o espaço disponível\",\n          \"description\": \"Se não habilitado, o reprodutor terá o mesmo tamanho do vídeo fornecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostrar controles do reprodutor de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Adiciona controles ao reprodutor de vídeo. Isso permite que o usuário reproduza o vídeo, pause, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Reprodução\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Reprodução automática de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"O vídeo é reproduzido automaticamente. Pode não funcionar em dispositivos móveis.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vídeo em loop\",\n          \"description\": \"Automaticamente reproduz o vídeo novamente após seu término.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localização de vídeo\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nome\",\n          \"default\": \"Vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Ajuda a identificar conteúdo deste tipo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Carregando\",\n          \"default\": \"Reprodutor de vídeo carregando...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nenhum reprodutor encontrado\",\n          \"default\": \"Nenhum reprodutor de vídeo para o formato fornecido foi encontrado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Sem fontes\",\n          \"default\": \"Vídeo não possui fonte.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Abortado\",\n          \"default\": \"A reprodução da mídia foi abortada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Falha de conexão\",\n          \"default\": \"Falha de conexão.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Não foi possível decodificar a mídia\",\n          \"default\": \"Não foi possível decodificar a mídia.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formato não suportado\",\n          \"default\": \"Formato de vídeo não suportado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mídia criptografada\",\n          \"default\": \"Mídia criptografada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erro desconhecido\",\n          \"default\": \"Erro desconhecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID do YouTube inválida\",\n          \"default\": \"ID do YouTube inválida.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID do YouTube desconhecida\",\n          \"default\": \"Incapaz de encontrar o vídeo dada a ID fornecida.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vídeo de YouTube restrito\",\n          \"default\": \"O proprietário deste vídeo não permite que seja embutido.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Acessibilidade\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Adicionar faixa de vídeo\",\n          \"entity\": \"Track\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Faixa\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Rótulo da faixa\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipo de categoria, referir a <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Legendas\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Legendas(Acessibilidade)\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descrições\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capítulos\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idioma fonte, deve ser definido para legendas\",\n                \"description\": \"Deve ser um rótulo de linguagem BCP 47 válido. Se \'Legendas\' é o tipo de faixa de texto seleciondo, a linguagem fonte da faixa de texto deve ser definida.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fonte da faixa (arquivo WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(611,32,'pt','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Ficheiros de vídeo\",\n      \"description\": \"Para assegurar que todos os navegadores suportem o vídeo, deve fazer o upload de ambos os formatos: WebM e MP4.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Visuais\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Imagem de capa\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Encaixar o leitor de vídeo para ocupar todo o espaço disponível\",\n          \"description\": \"Se desativado, o leitor terá o mesmo tamanho do vídeo fornecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mostrar controlos do leitor de vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Adiciona controlos ao leitor de vídeo. Permite que o utilizador reproduza o vídeo, faça pausa, etc.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Reprodução\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Reprodução automática do vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"O vídeo é reproduzido automaticamente. Pode não funcionar em dispositivos móveis.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Repetição do vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Reproduz novamenete o vídeo após terminar.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localização do vídeo\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nome\",\n          \"default\": \"Vídeo\",\n          \"description\": \"Ajuda a identificar conteúdo deste tipo.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"A carregar\",\n          \"default\": \"A carregar o leitor de vídeo...\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Nenhum leitor encontrado\",\n          \"default\": \"Nenhum leitor de vídeo foi encontrado para o formato fornecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Sem fontes\",\n          \"default\": \"Vídeo não possui fonte.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cancelado\",\n          \"default\": \"A reprodução foi cancelada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Falha na ligação\",\n          \"default\": \"Falha de ligação.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Não foi possível descodificar o ficheiro\",\n          \"default\": \"Não foi possível descodificar o ficheiro multimédia.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Formato não suportado\",\n          \"default\": \"Formato de vídeo não suportado.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Ficheiro protegido\",\n          \"default\": \"Ficheiro multimédia protegido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Erro desconhecido\",\n          \"default\": \"Erro desconhecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID do YouTube inválido\",\n          \"default\": \"ID do YouTube inválido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ID do YouTube desconhecido\",\n          \"default\": \"Não foi possível encontrar o vídeo com o ID fornecido.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Vídeo de YouTube restrito\",\n          \"default\": \"O proprietário deste vídeo não permite que seja incorporado.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Acessibilidade\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Adicionar faixa de vídeo\",\n          \"entity\": \"Faixa\",\n          \"field\": {\n            \"label\": \"Faixa\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Rótulo da faixa\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tipo de categoria, refere-se a <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-track-element\\\">HTML living standard</a>\",\n                \"options\": [\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Legendas\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Legendas (Acessibilidade)\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Descrições\"\n                  },\n                  {\n                    \"label\": \"Capítulos\"\n                  }\n                ]\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Idioma da fonte, deve ser definido para as legendas\",\n                \"description\": \"Deve ser um rótulo de linguagem BCP 47 válido. Se \'Legendas\' é o tipo de faixa de texto seleciondo, a linguagem fonte da faixa de texto deve ser definida.\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Fonte da faixa (ficheiro WebVTT)\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
