: \"Confirmar exclusão\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Mensagem\",\n          \"default\": \"Você tem certeza que deseja excluir este objetivo?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rótulo do botão Cancelar\",\n          \"default\": \"Cancelar\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rótulo do botão Confirmar\",\n          \"default\": \"Confirmar\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
(1758,89,'sl','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Opis\",\n      \"description\": \"Navodilo udeležencem za delo na strani s cilji.\",\n      \"default\": \"Vnesi cilje in njihove opise.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Gumb za dodajanje ciljev\",\n      \"description\": \"Besedilo bo zapisano na gumbu za dodajanje novega cilja.\",\n      \"default\": \"Nov cilj\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Besedilo z opisom cilja\",\n      \"description\": \"Besedilo bo prikazano pri ustvarjenem cilju.\",\n      \"default\": \"Opis cilja\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Nadomestno besedilo za cilj\",\n      \"description\": \"Besedilo bo udeležencu prikazano ob ustvarjenem cilju.\",\n      \"default\": \"Zapis cilja ...\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Besedilo števca za dodane cilje\",\n      \"default\": \"Dodani cilji:\",\n      \"description\": \"Števec beleži trenutno dodane cilje in jih zapiše za besedilo iz tega okna.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Besedilo za gumb \\\"Podrobnosti\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Podrobnosti\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Besedilo za gumb \\\"Odstrani\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Odstrani\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Naslov za dodatne informacije\",\n      \"description\": \"Besedilo se prikaže kot povezava, ki vodi do dodatnih informacij za udeležence.\",\n      \"default\": \"Več informacij\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Vsebina dodatnih informacij\",\n      \"description\": \"Besedilo se udeležencem prikaže v pogovornem oknu.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Določitev odstranitve cilja\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Besedilo naslova\",\n          \"default\": \"Potrditev odstranitve cilja\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Besedilo vsebine\",\n          \"default\": \"Resnično izbrišem izbran cilj?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Besedilo za gumb \\\"Prekliči\\\"\",\n          \"default\": \"Prekliči\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Besedilo za gumb \\\"Potrdi\\\"\",\n          \"default\": \"Potrdi\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(1759,89,'sma','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Description\",\n      \"description\": \"Description of the goals page.\",\n      \"default\": \"Insert the goals that you have chosen to work with.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Define goal link text\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be displayed on the button for creating a new goal.\",\n      \"default\": \"Create a new goal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Label for a user defined goal\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be displayed as label on a user created goal.\",\n      \"default\": \"User defined goal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Define goal placeholder\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be displayed as a placeholder when creating a new goal.\",\n      \"default\": \"Write here...\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text indicating how many goals has been added\",\n      \"default\": \"Goals added:\",\n      \"description\": \"This text will follow after the amount of goals that is currently created, example: \'Goals added: 5\' where \'Goals added:\' is this text.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for \\\"Specify goal\\\"-button\",\n      \"default\": \"Specification\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for \\\"Remove goal\\\"-button\",\n      \"default\": \"Remove\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Label for help text\",\n      \"description\": \"Label for showing additional helpful information to the user.\",\n      \"default\": \"More information\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Fill in additional help information\",\n      \"description\": \"Here you can fill in additional helpful information for the user.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Localize goal deletion confirmation\",\n      \"fields\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Header\",\n          \"default\": \"Confirm deletion\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Message\",\n          \"default\": \"Are you sure you want to delete this goal?\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Cancel button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Cancel\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Confirm button label\",\n          \"default\": \"Confirm\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}'),
