ced with the respective values for the card.\",\n          \"default\": \"Carta %num de %total:\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rótulo de carta não virada\",\n          \"default\": \"Não virado. Click to turn.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Card turned label\",\n          \"default\": \"Turned.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Rótulo de Carta-par\",\n          \"default\": \"Carta-par encontrada.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Card matched announcement\",\n          \"default\": \"Your cards match!\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Card not matched announcement\",\n          \"default\": \"Your chosen cards do not match. Turn other cards to try again.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
