 Erabili @current eta @total aldagai gisa.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Ausazko txartelak\",\n      \"description\": \"Gaitu pantailako txartelen ordena ausazkoa izatea.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2203,108,'fi','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tehtävänkuvaus\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Oletus\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"Kortit\",\n      \"entity\": \"kortti\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"Kortti\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Kysymys\",\n            \"description\": \"Kortin kysymysteksti, ei pakollinen kenttä. (kortti voi sisältää pelkän kuvan, pelkän tekstin tai sisältää kuvan ja tekstin)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Vastaus\",\n            \"description\": \"Vastaus (ei pakollinen kenttä). Use a forward slash / to split alternative solutions. Use \\\\/ if a solution should contain a /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Kuva\",\n            \"description\": \"Kortin kuva (ei pakollinen kenttä) Kortti voi sisältää pelkän kuvan, pelkän tekstin tai sisältää kuvan ja tekstin\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Alternative text for image\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Vihje\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Vihjeteksti\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Etenemisteksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Kortti @card / @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Etenemisteksti, käytettävissä olevat muuttujat @card ja @total Esimerkiksi: \'Kortti @card / @total\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Seuraava-painikkeen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Seuraava\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Takaisin-painikkeen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Takaisin\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tarkista vastaukset -painikkeen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Tarkista vastaukset\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Vaadi käyttäjältä vastaus ennen kuin ratkaisu näytetään.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Vastauskentän teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Vastauksesi\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Oikean vastauksen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Oikein\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Väärän vastauksen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Väärin\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Näytä vastaukset teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Oikea vastaus\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tulokset otsikko\",\n      \"default\": \"Tulokset\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Teksti oikein saaduille vastauksille\",\n      \"default\": \"@score / @total oikein\",\n      \"description\": \"tulosteksti, käytettävissä olevat muuttujat: @score ja @total. Esimerkki: \'@score / @total oikein\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Näytä tulokset teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"Näytä tulokset\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Lyhyen vastauksen teksti\",\n      \"default\": \"A:\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Teksti \\\"retry\\\" painikkeelle\",\n      \"default\": \"Yritä uudelleen\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"merkkikokoriippuvainen\",\n      \"description\": \"Määrittää tuleeko vastauksen olla identtinen määritellyn vastauksen mukaisesti (eli isot ja pienet kirjaimet huomioidaan jne.)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Incorrect text for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"Incorrect answer. Correct answer was @answer\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies. Use @answer as variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Correct feedback text for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer is correct.\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies when a card is answered correctly. Use @answer as variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Card change for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"Page @current of @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies when navigating between cards. Use @current and @total as variables.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Sekoita kortit\",\n      \"description\": \"Tällä valinnalla voit satunnaistaa korttien esiintymisjärjestyksen.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2204,108,'fr','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Consigne\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Par défaut\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"Cartes\",\n      \"entity\": \"carte\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"Carte\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Question\",\n            \"description\": \"Question facultative pour la carte. (La carte peut contenir une image seule, un texte seul ou les deux combinés)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Réponse\",\n            \"description\": \"Réponse (solution) pour la carte. Utiliser une barre oblique / pour séparer les solutions alternatives. Utilisez \\\\/ si une solution doit contenir un /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Image\",\n            \"description\": \"Image facultative pour la carte. (La carte peut contenir une image seule, un texte seul ou les deux combinés)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Texte alternatif pour l\'image\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Indice\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Texte de l\'indice\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte de progression\",\n      \"default\": \"Carte @card sur @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Texte de progression, variables possibles : @card et @total. (Exemple : \'Carte @card sur @total\')\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le bouton \\\"Suivant\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Suivant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le bouton \\\"Précédent\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Précédent\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le bouton \\\"Vérifier\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Vérifier\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Obliger l\'utilisateur à entrer une réponse avant de pouvoir afficher la correction\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le champ de saisie de la réponse\",\n      \"default\": \"Votre réponse\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour la bonne réponse\",\n      \"default\": \"Réponse exacte\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour une mauvaise réponse\",\n      \"default\": \"Réponse inexacte\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Afficher le texte de la solution\",\n      \"default\": \"Réponse(s) correcte(s)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour l\'intitulé des résultats\",\n      \"default\": \"Résultats\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le nombre de bonnes réponses\",\n      \"default\": \"@score réponses correctes sur un total de @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Texte des résultats, variables disponibles: @score et @total. Exemple: \'@score réponses correctes sur un total de @total\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour montrer les résultats\",\n      \"default\": \"Montrer les résultats\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour l\'intitulé de réponse courte\",\n      \"default\": \"R :\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte pour le bouton \\\"Recommencer\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Recommencer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Sensible à la casse\",\n      \"description\": \"Impose que la saisie de l\'utilisateur soit strictement identique à la réponse attendue.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texte de réponse incorrecte pour les outils d\'accessibilité\",\n      \"default\": \"Réponse incorrecte. La réponse correcte était @answer\",\n      \"description\": \"Texte qui sera annoncé aux outils d\'accessibilité. Utilisez @réponse comme variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Feedback de réponse correcte pour les outils d\'accessibilité\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer est correct.\",\n      \"description\": \"Texte qui sera annoncé aux outils d\'accessibilité lorsqu\'une réponse correcte est donnée. Utilisez @réponse comme variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Changement de carte pour les outils d\'accessibilité\",\n      \"default\": \"Page @current de @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Texte qui sera annoncé aux outils d\'accessibilité lors de la navigation entre les cartes. Utilisez @current et @total comme variables.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Mélanger les cartes\",\n      \"description\": \"Activer l\'affichage des réponses dans un ordre aléatoire.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2205,108,'gl','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Descrición da tarefa\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Por defecto\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"Tarxetas\",\n      \"entity\": \"tarxeta\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"Tarxeta\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Pregunta\",\n            \"description\": \"Pregunta de texto opcional para a tarxeta. (A tarxeta pode usar só unha imaxe, só texto ou ambos)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Resposta\",\n            \"description\": \"Resposta (solución) para a tarxeta. Use a forward slash / to split alternative solutions. Use \\\\/ if a solution should contain a /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Imaxe\",\n            \"description\": \"Imaxe opcional para a tarxeta. (A tarxeta pode usar só unha imaxe, só texto ou ambos)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Texto alternativo para a imaxe\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Pista\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Texto da pista\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto de progreso\",\n      \"default\": \"Tarxeta @card de @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Texto de progreso; variables dispoñibles: @card e @total. Exemplo: \'Tarxeta @card de @total\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o botón seguinte\",\n      \"default\": \"Seguinte\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o botón anterior\",\n      \"default\": \"Anterior\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o botón comprobar respostas\",\n      \"default\": \"Comprobar\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Requerir resposta do usuario antes de que poida ver a solución\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o campo de resposta\",\n      \"default\": \"A túa resposta\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para resposta correcta\",\n      \"default\": \"Correcto\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para resposta incorrecta\",\n      \"default\": \"Incorrecta\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para amosar a solución\",\n      \"default\": \"Resposta(s) correcta(s)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o título dos resultados\",\n      \"default\": \"Resultados\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para número de respostas correctas\",\n      \"default\": \"@score de @total son correctas\",\n      \"description\": \"Texto para resultados, variables dispoñibles: @score e @total. Exemplo: \'@score de @total son correctas\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para amosar resultados\",\n      \"default\": \"Amosar resultados\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para etiqueta de resposta curta\",\n      \"default\": \"R:\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto para o botón \\\"reintentar\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Reintentar\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Diferencia entre maiúsculas e minúsculas\",\n      \"description\": \"Fai que o texto introducido polo usuario teña que ser exactamente igual que a resposta.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto de resposta incorrecta para tecnoloxías de asistencia\",\n      \"default\": \"Resposta incorrecta. A resposta correcta era @answer\",\n      \"description\": \"O texto pasarase ás tecnoloxías de asistencia. Usa @answer como variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Texto de retroalimentación de resposta correcta para as tecnoloxías de asistencia\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer é correcta.\",\n      \"description\": \"Texto que se anunciará ás tecnoloxías de asistencia cando o usuario responde a unha tarxeta correctamente. Usa @answer como variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Cambio de tarxeta para as tecnoloxías de asistencia\",\n      \"default\": \"Páxina @current de @total\",\n      \"description\": \"O texto pasarase ás tecnoloxías de asistencia cando se navegue entre tarxetas. Usa @current e @total como variables.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Facer aleatorias as tarxetas\",\n      \"description\": \"Activar para facer aleatoria a orde das tarxetas amosadas.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2206,108,'he','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"תיאור משימה\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"ברירת מחדל\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"כרטיסים\",\n      \"entity\": \"כרטיס\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"כרטיס\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"שאלה\",\n            \"description\": \"שאלה טקסטואלית אופציונלית לכרטיס. (הכרטיס עשוי להשתמש רק בתמונה, רק בטקסט או בשניהם)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"תשובה\",\n            \"description\": \"תשובה (פתרון) לכרטיס. השתמש בסמל צינור / לפצל פתרונות חלופיים. השתמש ב-\\\\/ אם פתרון צריך להכיל /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"תמונה\",\n            \"description\": \"תמונה אופציונלית לכרטיס. (הכרטיס עשוי להשתמש רק בתמונה, רק בטקסט או בשניהם)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"טקסט חלופי לתמונה\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"עצה\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"תוכן העצה\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט התקדמות\",\n      \"default\": \"כרטיס @card מתוך @total\",\n      \"description\": \"תוית התקדמות, משתנים זמינים: @card ו-@total. דוגמה: \'כרטיס @card של @total\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לכפתור הבא\",\n      \"default\": \"הבא\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לכפתור הקודם\",\n      \"default\": \"הקודם\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לכפתור בדיקת התשובות\",\n      \"default\": \"בדיקה\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"דרושת תגובת משתמש לפני שניתן יהיה לצפות בפתרון\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט עבור שדה הקלט של התשובה\",\n      \"default\": \"תשובתך\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לתשובה הנכונה\",\n      \"default\": \"נכון\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לתשובה לא נכונה\",\n      \"default\": \"שגוי\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"הראה טקסט לתשובה\",\n      \"default\": \"תשובות נכונות\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לכותרת התוצאות\",\n      \"default\": \"תוצאות\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט למספר הנכונות\",\n      \"default\": \"@score מתוך @total נכונים\",\n      \"description\": \"טקסט תוצאה, משתנים זמינים: @score ו-@total. דוגמה: \'@score של @total הנכונות\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט לתוצאות המופע\",\n      \"default\": \"תצוגת תוצאות\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט עבור תווית תשובות קצרות\",\n      \"default\": \"A:\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט עבור כפתור \\\"נסה שוב\\\".\",\n      \"default\": \"ניסיון חוזר\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"התאמה לאותיות גדולות/קנות באנגלית\",\n      \"description\": \"מוודא שתשובת המשתמש חייבת להיות זהה בדיוק לתשובה.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"תוכן לא נכון עבור טכנולוגיות מסייעות\",\n      \"default\": \"תשובה לא נכונה. התשובה הנכונה הייתה anwser@\",\n      \"description\": \"תוכן יוקרא בקול לטכנולוגיות מסייעות. השתמשו ב- answer@ כמשתנה.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"טקסט משוב נכון עבור טכנולוגיות מסייעות\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer תשובה נכונה.\",\n      \"description\": \"טקסט שיוכרז לטכנולוגיות מסייעות כאשר כרטיס יענה נכון. השתמש ב-@answer כמשתנה.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"החלפת כרטיס עבור טכנולוגיות מסייעות\",\n      \"default\": \"דף current@ מתוך total@\",\n      \"description\": \"תוכן שיוקרא לטכנולוגיות מסייעות בעת ניווט בין כרטיסים. השתמשו ב- current@ ו- total@ כמשתנים.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"כרטיסים אקראיים\",\n      \"description\": \"אפשר להפוך את סדר הקלפים המוצגים באופן אקראי.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2207,108,'hu','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Task description\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Default\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"Cards\",\n      \"entity\": \"card\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"Card\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Question\",\n            \"description\": \"Optional textual question for the card. (The card may use just an image, just a text or both)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Answer\",\n            \"description\": \"Answer (solution) for the card. Use a forward slash / to split alternative solutions. Use \\\\/ if a solution should contain a /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Image\",\n            \"description\": \"Optional image for the card. (The card may use just an image, just a text or both)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Alternative text for image\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Tip\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Tip text\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Progress text\",\n      \"default\": \"Card @card of @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Progress text, variables available: @card and @total. Example: \'Card @card of @total\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for the next button\",\n      \"default\": \"Next\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for the previous button\",\n      \"default\": \"Previous\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for the check answers button\",\n      \"default\": \"Check\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Require user input before the solution can be viewed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for the answer input field\",\n      \"default\": \"Your answer\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for correct answer\",\n      \"default\": \"Correct\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for incorrect answer\",\n      \"default\": \"Incorrect\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Show solution text\",\n      \"default\": \"Correct answer(s)\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for results title\",\n      \"default\": \"Results\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for number of correct\",\n      \"default\": \"@score of @total correct\",\n      \"description\": \"Result text, variables available: @score and @total. Example: \'@score of @total correct\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for show results\",\n      \"default\": \"Show results\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for short answer label\",\n      \"default\": \"A:\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Text for \\\"retry\\\" button\",\n      \"default\": \"Retry\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Case sensitive\",\n      \"description\": \"Makes sure the user input has to be exactly the same as the answer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Incorrect text for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"Incorrect answer. Correct answer was @answer\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies. Use @answer as variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Correct feedback text for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer is correct.\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies when a card is answered correctly. Use @answer as variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Card change for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"Page @current of @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies when navigating between cards. Use @current and @total as variables.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Randomize cards\",\n      \"description\": \"Enable to randomize the order of cards on display.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
(2208,108,'it','{\n  \"semantics\": [\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Descrizione del compito\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"widgets\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Predefinito\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"label\": \"Schede\",\n      \"entity\": \"scheda\",\n      \"field\": {\n        \"label\": \"Scheda\",\n        \"fields\": [\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Domanda\",\n            \"description\": \"Domanda testuale facoltativa per la scheda (la scheda può utilizzare solo un\'immagine, solo un testo o entrambi)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Risposta\",\n            \"description\": \"Risposta (soluzione) facoltativa per la scheda Use a forward slash / to split alternative solutions. Use \\\\/ if a solution should contain a /.\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Immagine\",\n            \"description\": \"Immagine facoltativa per la scheda (la scheda può utilizzare solo un\'immagine, solo un testo o entrambi)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Testo alternativo per l\'immagine\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"label\": \"Suggerimento\",\n            \"fields\": [\n              {\n                \"label\": \"Testo del suggerimento\"\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo di avanzamento\",\n      \"default\": \"Scheda @card di @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Testo di avanzamento, variabili disponibili: @card e @total. Esempio: \'Scheda @card di @total\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo per il pulsante \\\"Prossima\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Prossima\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo per il pulsante \\\"Precedente\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Precedente\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo per il pulsante \\\"Verifica\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Verifica\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Richiedere l\'immissione dei dati all\'utente prima che la soluzione sia visualizzata\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Messaggio della casella di testo per la risposta\",\n      \"default\": \"La tua risposta\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Messaggio per risposta giusta\",\n      \"default\": \"Giusto\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Messaggio per risposta sbagliata\",\n      \"default\": \"Sbagliato\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Mostra il testo della soluzione\",\n      \"default\": \"Risposta giusta\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Titolo del messaggio per i risultati\",\n      \"default\": \"Risultati\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Messaggio per il numero di risposte giuste\",\n      \"default\": \"@score su @total giuste\",\n      \"description\": \"Messaggio del risultato, variabili disponibili: @score e @total. Esempio: \'@score su @total giuste\'\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Messaggio per mostrare i risultati\",\n      \"default\": \"Mostra i risultati\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo per l\'etichetta della risposta breve\",\n      \"default\": \"A:\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo per il pulsante \\\"Riprova\\\"\",\n      \"default\": \"Riprova\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Tieni conto di maiuscole e minuscole\",\n      \"description\": \"Accertati che il testo immesso dall\'utente sia identico alla risposta attesa\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Testo sbagliato per le tecnologie assistive\",\n      \"default\": \"Risposta sbagliata. La risposta giusta era @answer\",\n      \"description\": \"Testo per le tecnologie assistive. Usa @answer come variabile\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Correct feedback text for assistive technologies\",\n      \"default\": \"@answer is correct.\",\n      \"description\": \"Text that will be announced to assistive technologies when a card is answered correctly. Use @answer as variable.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Cambio scheda per le tecnologie assistive\",\n      \"default\": \"Pagina @current di @total\",\n      \"description\": \"Testo per le tecnologie assistive durante la navigazione tra schede. Usa @current e @total come variabili\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"label\": \"Randomize cards\",\n      \"description\": \"Enable to randomize the order of cards on display.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n'),
