(5,-10,4,'Curso concluído','Parabéns!\n\nVocê concluiu o curso Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (LGPD) [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost:8080/course/view.php?id=2\n',1,'<p>Parabéns!</p><p>Você concluiu o curso <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/course/view.php?id=2\">Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (LGPD)</a>.</p>','Parabéns!\n\nVocê concluiu o curso Lei Geral de Proteção de Dados (LGPD) [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost:8080/course/view.php?id=2\n','moodle','coursecompleted',NULL,NULL,NULL,1779450284,'{\"notificationpictureurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/pluginfile.php\\/19\\/course\\/overviewfiles\\/SYONET%20%284%29.png\",\"courseid\":\"2\"}'),
(6,2,2,'Moodle updates are available (http://localhost:8080)','Update notifications\n\nThere is a newer Moodle version available!\nMoodle 5.2+ (Build: 20260519) Version 2026042000.04 (Stable version)\n\nSee http://localhost:8080/admin/index.php for more details\n\nIt is strongly recommended that you update your site to the latest version to obtain all recent security and bug fixes.\n\nYour Moodle site http://localhost:8080 is configured to automatically check for available updates. You are receiving this message as the administrator of the site. You can disable automatic checks for available updates in Site administration / Server / Update notifications or customise the delivery of this message via your preferences page.\n',2,'<h1>Update notifications</h1>\n<h2>There is a newer Moodle version available!</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Moodle 5.2+ (Build: 20260519)</strong> Version 2026042000.04 (Stable version)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/admin/index.php\">http://localhost:8080/admin/index.php</a> for more details</p>\n<p>It is strongly recommended that you update your site to the latest version to obtain all recent security and bug fixes.</p>\n<footer><p style=\"font-size:smaller; color:#333;\">Your Moodle site <a href=\"http://localhost:8080\">http://localhost:8080</a> is configured to automatically check for available updates. You are receiving this message as the administrator of the site. You can disable automatic checks for available updates in Site administration / Server / Update notifications or customise the delivery of this message via your preferences page.</p></footer>','Update notifications','moodle','availableupdate',NULL,NULL,NULL,1779741169,NULL),
(7,-10,2,'New sign in to your EAD Parvi account','Hi Admin User,\n\nYour EAD Parvi account was just signed in to from a new device.\n\n	* Your account: admin admin@parvi.com.br\n	* Monday, 25 May 2026, 1:34 PM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\n	* IP: 172.19.0.1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost:8080/login/change_password.php\n',1,'<p>Hi Admin User,</p>\n<p>Your EAD Parvi account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: admin admin@parvi.com.br</li>\n<li>Monday, 25 May 2026, 1:34 PM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36</li>\n<li>IP: 172.19.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>','Your admin account was just signed in to from a new device.','moodle','newlogin',NULL,NULL,NULL,1779741229,'{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/theme\\/image.php\\/moove\\/core\\/1779712430\\/u\\/f1\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}'),
(8,-10,6,'New sign in to your EAD Parvi account','Hi Paulo André Soares,\n\nYour EAD Parvi account was just signed in to from a new device.\n\n	* Your account: paulo.andre paulo.andre@parvi.com.br\n	* Monday, 25 May 2026, 1:40 PM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\n	* IP: 172.19.0.1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost:8080/login/change_password.php\n',1,'<p>Hi Paulo André Soares,</p>\n<p>Your EAD Parvi account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: paulo.andre paulo.andre@parvi.com.br</li>\n<li>Monday, 25 May 2026, 1:40 PM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36</li>\n<li>IP: 172.19.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>','Your paulo.andre account was just signed in to from a new device.','moodle','newlogin',NULL,NULL,NULL,1779741229,'{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/theme\\/image.php\\/moove\\/core\\/1779712430\\/u\\/f1\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}'),
